ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's soundtrack combines the sounds of 90s music hardware with modern synthesis and samples to create something authentic and exciting. <i>BIRDCAGE</i> features over an hour of dynamic music, hundreds of bespoke sound effects and retro-styled voice acting for stage bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/77da28bb605def8be1d9a213362f2c9a.webp?t=1770984370\" width=508 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind has branched into space and two opposing factions have emerged. On one side, SELENE, in control of the Moon and what remains of Earth, on the other, RADON, in control of the space colony CAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by Mother ROENTGEN, the RADON Daughters have ordered GENOME Control to create a new breed of weapon. A weapon to end Earth’s reign and birth a new universe, the WORLD-EGG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep inside the CAGE, a pilot awakens in the cockpit of the HALCYON - an experimental RADON gunship. Inside the newly-hatched Pilot’s mind, a Voice echoes: Destroy the WORLD-EGG.</p>",
